BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 66.00 234.50 Td (power action verbs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.15 g 54.00 214.00 Td (From an engineering and cloud perspective, enterprise resume analysis requires:) Tj ET
